Maintainer: SuperMox <noreply@supermox.me>
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), rsvg-convert, imagemagick
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://supermox.org

Package: supermox-ui
Architecture: all
Depends: proxmox-widget-toolkit,
         ${misc:Depends}
Description: SuperMox web UI assets (dark theme, logo, favicon)
 Installs the SuperMox dark theme for the widget toolkit and the SuperMox
 logo and favicon that pveproxy serves. The theme CSS is dropped into the
 widget toolkit themes directory (served at /pwt/themes/ as theme-supermox-
 dark.css) and the logo and favicon PNGs, rendered from the SuperMox symbol
 SVG, into /usr/share/supermox-ui/images/ (served at /supermox/).
